  "agent_check": "The runner takes no capture between steps: the clean-state Given (toolbar Recompute button disabled) and the dirty-state Then (tc-12-07-props.png: old 5 mm pad still drawn, touched marker on the Pad row where Body is expanded, Recompute button enabled) are not captured; the Edit > Recompute step succeeding is the only scripted sign the command was enabled. Re-run those two GUI reads by hand, then judge the capture: no touched or error marker on any tree row, Recompute button disabled again, a solid visibly taller than the 5 mm plate (20 x 10 x 8). The script does not check these Thens; check each one in the gate run: Given: toolbar Recompute button reads disabled (GUI action); GUI dirty state: Recompute enabled and the touched marker in the tree (GUI action)."
}
